    "summary": "Costs 1 CP. Use this in either [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) on an **ADEPTA SORORITAS** unit still waiting to be chosen to fight. This turn, it can go 6\" instead of 3\" on [Pile-In Moves](vsdata:core-rule/pile-in-move) or [Consolidation Moves](vsdata:core-rule/consolidation-move). If it is [Righteous](vsdata:ability/adepta-sororitas.champions-of-faith.righteous-purpose), it can finish at the minimum possible distance from the closest enemy unit in place of ending nearer the closest enemy model.",
